The Kilrathi's new IFF missile was first deployed during the violations of the False Peace. The new missile had a longer range and loitering time, more reliable tracking systems that were less likely to be duped by countermeasures, and the ability to re-lock on another target if the original lock was lost. The news of this new missile reached ConFleet Intel, who soon developed their own variant of this missile."
